AB  - Generative AI (GenAI) and Virtual Reality offer transformative opportunities for student engagement and provide authentic learning experiences for STEM students at HBCUs. This article aims to introduce and facilitate the use of an AI-enhanced immersive learning framework that integrates virtual reality (VR) and generative artificial intelligence (GenAI) within the Research Simulation Case Study (RSCS) model, aligning with the Utilitarian Scientific Literacy approach. Through a combination of immersive and personalized GenAI learning, this framework aims to address challenges related to student persistence, STEM identity development and, access to rich, authentic research experiences that can be scaled to computing education.
